      "sourceTextSha256": "5d13d7524b75656431a8cfc6d19ce1bb6716e2f0011a9896e3317a3cafd4452c",
      "text": "El Calafate and Perito Moreno Glacier",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-483534e9353b46a8be6f54221df32d47",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f2625db0472ad138b3625949ade86aedeef56d3df40efd284bdee69a2fd93c28",
      "text": "After breakfast, join a group tour to Perito Moreno Glacier with an English-speaking guide.\n\nYou will travel to Los Glaciares National Park. On the way, your guide will explain how the glacier shapes its surroundings and introduce you to the park.\n\nThe first stop is at a network of walkways and viewing platforms overlooking the broad ice face. Perito Moreno is a moving glacier, and from the viewpoints you may see large chunks of ice break off and fall into the water.\n\nAfter the walk, the tour continues by bus through the park, with different views of the mountains, lakes and glacier along the way. Then return to your hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-483534e9353b46a8be6f54221df32d47",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      }
